message: >-
  If you use this reproducible static-analysis artifact, cite the repository version
  and the accompanying report. This is a project artifact, not a peer-reviewed paper.
title: >-
  Static package survey of the user-supplied Zalopay 11.17.0 XAPK
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-25
type: software
abstract: >-
  Offline static inventory, manifest and DEX metadata survey, recursive SHA-256
  catalog, and Vietnamese explainer video for one supplied Android XAPK. No app
  execution, network interaction, source recovery, or safety certification is claimed.
